WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
[Birdsong] Morning sun over green fields.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Carrot, beetroot and mango gather in a basket.
[Soft harvest sounds]

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Fresh produce is rinsed. [Running water]

00:21.000 --> 00:28.500
A slow press releases the juice.
[Low mechanical hum, dripping]

00:28.500 --> 00:36.000
Green and orange juice fills GlowRoot bottles.
[Pouring]

00:36.000 --> 00:39.000
The bottles are capped. [Caps closing]

00:39.000 --> 00:46.000
Five colourful bottles, each with a matching cap.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.000
Mango, watermelon, litchi, grapes and sugarcane.
[Birdsong]

00:52.000 --> 00:56.000
Colours and ingredients gather into the logo.
[Gentle droplets]

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
GlowRoot. Nature’s Palette.
